root\">الطَّعَام</span>","hinglish":"Khana / Ta'am","translations":{"en":"Food","ur":"کھانا / طعام","hi":"खाना / भोजन"}},{"id":"s1l4_g1_w34","arabic":"الْقَادِر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَادِر</span>","hinglish":"Qadir / Qudrat wala","translations":{"en":"All-Powerful / Capable","ur":"قادر / قدرت والا","hi":"क़ादिर / समर्थ"}},{"id":"s1l4_g1_w35","arabic":"الْفَاجِر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفَاجِر</span>","hinglish":"Gunahgar / Fajir","translations":{"en":"Wicked / Transgressor","ur":"گناہگار / فاجر","hi":"गुनहगार / पापी"}},{"id":"s1l4_g1_w36","arabic":"الْوَارِث","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">الْوَارِث</span>","hinglish":"Waris / Maalik banne wala","translations":{"en":"The Inheritor / Heir","ur":"وارث / مالک بننے والا","hi":"वारिस / उत्तराधिकारी"}}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s1l4_r2","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Munasib hai ke iss kitaab mein jo lafz aapko mushkil lage use highlight ya underline kar lein, taake woh numayan ho jaye aur yaad rakhna aasan ho."}},{"id":"sec_s1l4_lbl3","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"**Exercise (Practice):** Darj zail Qur'ani aayaton mein se un alfaaz ko highlight karein jinhe aap mukammal taur par samajhte hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l4_v4","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s1l4_v4_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"يُعْجِبُكَ قَوْلُهُ فِي الْحَيَاةِ الدُّنْيَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">يُعْجِبُكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْلُهُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حَيَاةِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الدُّنْيَا</span>","hinglish":"Uski baat dunya ki zindagi mein tumhen pasand aati hai","translations":{"ur":"اس کی بات دنیا کی زندگی میں تمہیں پسند آتی ہے","en":"Whose speech pleases you in worldly life","hi":"उसकी बात दुनिया की ज़िंदगी में तुम्हें पसंद आती है"},"ref":"2:204"},{"id":"s1l4_v4_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"كُنْتُمْ تَمَنَّوْنَ الْمَوْتَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">كُنْتُمْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَمَنَّوْنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَو</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ْتَ</span>","hinglish":"Tum maut ki tamanna karte the","translations":{"ur":"تم موت کی تمنا کرتے تھے","en":"You used to wish for death","hi":"तुम मौत की तमन्ना करते थे"},"ref":"3:143"},{"id":"s1l4_v4_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"إِنَّمَا أُنْذِرُكُمْ بِالْوَحْيِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّمَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أُنْذِر</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُكُمْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِالْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">وَحْيِ</span>","hinglish":"Main to tumhen wahy ke zariye hi darata hoon","translations":{"ur":"میں تو تمہیں وحی کے ذریعے ہی ڈراتا ہوں","en":"I only warn you by revelation","hi":"मैं तो तुम्हें वही के ज़रिये ही डराता हूँ"},"ref":"21:45"},{"id":"s1l4_v4_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"وَلَوْ كُنْتَ فَظًّا غَلِيظَ الْقَلْبِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلَوْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كُنْتَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فَظًّا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَلِيظَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">قَلْبِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur agar tum bad-khulq aur sakht dil hote","translations":{"ur":"اور اگر تم بدخلق اور سخت دل ہوتے","en":"And if you had been rude and harsh in heart","hi":"और अगर तुम बदख़ुल्क़ और सख़्त दिल होते"},"ref":"3:159"},{"id":"s1l4_v4_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ الْكِتَابَ وَالْحِكْمَةَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">كِتَابَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَالْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حِكْمَةَ</span>","hinglish":"Aur woh unhen kitaab aur hikmat sikhata hai","translations":{"ur":"اور وہ انہیں کتاب اور حکمت سکھاتا ہے","en":"And teaches them the Book and wisdom","hi":"और वह उन्हें किताब और हिकमत सिखाता है"}},{"id":"s1l4_v4_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"مِنَ الظُّلُمَاتِ إِلَى النُّورِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الظُّلُمَاتِ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النُّورِ</span>","hinglish":"Andheron se roshni ki taraf","translations":{"en":"From darknesses into light","ur":"اندھیروں سے روشنی کی طرف","hi":"अंधेरों से रोशनी की तरफ़"},"ref":"2:257"},{"id":"s1l4_v4_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"ن وَالْقَلَمِ وَمَا يَسْطُرُونَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">ن</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَالْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">قَلَمِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَمَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَسْطُر</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُونَ</span>","hinglish":"Noon! Qalam ki aur jo woh likhte hain uski qasam","translations":{"ur":"ن! قلم کی اور جو وہ لکھتے ہیں اس کی قسم","en":"Nun. By the pen and what they inscribe","hi":"नून! क़लम की और जो वे लिखते हैं उसकी क़सम"},"ref":"68:1"},{"id":"s1l4_v4_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"أَمْ عِنْدَهُمُ الْغَيْبُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَمْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِنْدَهُمُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْغَيْبُ</span>","hinglish":"Kya unke paas ghaib (ka ilm) hai","translations":{"en":"Or have they knowledge of the unseen","ur":"یا کیا ان کے پاس غیب کا علم ہے","hi":"या क्या उनके पास ग़ैब का इल्म है"}},{"id":"s1l4_v4_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"وَأَنَّ اللهَ شَدِيدُ الْعَذَابِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأَنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللهَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَدِيدُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">عَذَابِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur ke beshak Allah bohot sakht azab wala hai","translations":{"ur":"اور یہ کہ بیشک اللہ بہت سخت عذاب والا ہے","en":"And that Allah is severe in penalty","hi":"और यह कि बेशक अल्लाह बहुत सख़्त अज़ाब वाला है"},"ref":"2:165"},{"id":"s1l4_v4_s10","sentence_number":10,"arabic":"نَزَّلَ الْكِتَابَ بِالْحَقِّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">نَزَّلَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">كِتَابَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِالْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حَقِّ</span>","hinglish":"Usne haq ke saath kitaab naazil ki","translations":{"ur":"اس نے حق کے ساتھ کتاب نازل کی","en":"He has sent down the Book in truth","hi":"उसने हक़ के साथ किताब नाज़िल की"},"ref":"2:176"},{"id":"s1l4_v4_s11","sentence_number":11,"arabic":"فِي الدُّنْيَا حَسَنَةً وَفِي الْآخِرَةِ حَسَنَةً","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الدُّنْيَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَسَنَةً</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَفِي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">آخِرَةِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَسَنَةً</span>","hinglish":"Dunya mein bhi bhalai aur aakhirat mein bhi bhalai","translations":{"ur":"دنیا میں بھی بھلائی اور آخرت میں بھی بھلائی","en":"Good in this world and good in the Hereafter","hi":"दुनिया में भी भलाई और आख़िरत में भी भलाई"},"ref":"2:201"},{"id":"s1l4_v4_s12","sentence_number":12,"arabic":"وَأَلْقَيْتُ عَلَيْكَ مَحَبَّةً مِنِّي","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأَلْقَي</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ْتُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَيْكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَحَبَّةً</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنِّي</span>","hinglish":"Aur maine tum par apni taraf se muhabbat dal di","translations":{"ur":"اور میں نے تم پر اپنی طرف سے محبت ڈال دی","en":"And I bestowed upon you love from Me","hi":"और मैंने तुम पर अपनी तरफ़ से मुहब्बत डाल दी"},"ref":"20:39"}],"cols":3}}]}}